{"id":70528,"date":"2026-10-23T09:08:04","date_gmt":"2026-10-23T08:08:04","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=70528"},"modified":"2026-10-23T09:12:10","modified_gmt":"2026-10-23T08:12:10","slug":"sesimbra-spartan-trifecta","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sesimbra-spartan-trifecta\/","title":{"rendered":"Sesimbra Spartan Trifecta 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Sesimbra Spartan Trifecta 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Sesimbra Spartan Trifecta 2026<\/strong> (<em>Sesimbra Spartan Weekend 2026<\/em>) realiza-se nos dias <strong>7 e 8 de novembro de 2026<\/strong> na <strong>Praia da Calif\u00f3rnia<\/strong>, em <strong>Sesimbra<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Set\u00fabal<\/strong>. Organizado pela <strong>Spartan Race Portugal<\/strong> em parceria com a <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Sesimbra<\/strong>, este evento oficial da <em>Wolf Season<\/em> re\u00fane as tr\u00eas dist\u00e2ncias cl\u00e1ssicas de corrida de obst\u00e1culos (OCR) num \u00fanico fim de semana, permitindo aos atletas conquistar a cobi\u00e7ada medalha <em>Trifecta<\/em> entre o areal atl\u00e2ntico, as encostas da Arr\u00e1bida e o Castelo de Sesimbra.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">No s\u00e1bado, <strong>7 de novembro<\/strong>, o Festival Spartan e o levantamento de dorsais abrem \u00e0s <strong>07h30<\/strong>, dando in\u00edcio \u00e0 <strong>Spartan Beast 21K<\/strong> (21 km e 30 obst\u00e1culos) \u00e0s <strong>09h00<\/strong> (Elite), <strong>09h15<\/strong> (Age Group) e <strong>10h00<\/strong> (Open), seguida da primeira edi\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong>Spartan Sprint 5K<\/strong> (5 km e 20 obst\u00e1culos) \u00e0s <strong>13h00<\/strong> e da <strong>Spartan Kids Race 1\u20133K<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>15h00<\/strong>. No domingo, <strong>8 de novembro<\/strong>, disputa-se a <strong>Spartan Super 10K<\/strong> (10 km e 25 obst\u00e1culos) \u00e0s <strong>09h00<\/strong> (Elite), <strong>09h15<\/strong> (Age Group) e <strong>10h00<\/strong> (Open), encerrando \u00e0s <strong>13h00<\/strong> com novas vagas Open da <strong>Spartan Sprint 5K<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis com pre\u00e7os iniciais de <strong>177,01 \u20ac<\/strong> na Beast 21K, <strong>148,50 \u20ac<\/strong> na Super 10K, <strong>108,58 \u20ac<\/strong> na Sprint 5K, <strong>34,47 \u20ac<\/strong> na Kids Race (1 a 3 km) e <strong>332,00 \u20ac<\/strong> para o <em>Trifecta Pass Portugal<\/em> (que inclui acesso \u00e0s tr\u00eas provas Sprint, Super e Beast). Todos os participantes recebem t-shirt oficial Finisher, medalha da respetiva dist\u00e2ncia (e cunho da Trifecta), cronometragem por chip e acesso \u00e0 zona de recupera\u00e7\u00e3o do festival na Praia da Calif\u00f3rnia. Explora tamb\u00e9m o calend\u00e1rio das melhores <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/meia-maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Meias Maratonas em Portugal<\/a> e prepara a tua prova na <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Ritmo (Pace)<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">7 a 8 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/