content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">OCR Super 10K<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Spartan Super 10K (25 Obst\u00e1culos)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 08 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Pre\u00e7o Inicial:<\/strong> 148.50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Vagas Elite 09:00 | Age Group 09:15 | Open 10:00)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">OCR Sprint 5K<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Spartan Sprint 5K (20 Obst\u00e1culos) &#8211; S\u00e1bado<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 07 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 13:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Pre\u00e7o Inicial:<\/strong> 108.58 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Vagas Open a partir das 13:00)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">OCR Sprint 5K<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Spartan Sprint 5K (20 Obst\u00e1culos) &#8211; Domingo<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 08 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 13:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Pre\u00e7o Inicial:<\/strong> 108.58 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Vagas Open a partir das 13:00)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">OCR Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Spartan Kids Race 1\u20133K (+ Obst\u00e1culos)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 07 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 15:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Pre\u00e7o Inicial:<\/strong> 34.47 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Dos 4 aos 14 anos)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando se realiza o Sesimbra Spartan Trifecta 2026 e onde se localiza a arena do evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Sesimbra Spartan Trifecta 2026 realiza-se no fim de semana de <strong>7 e 8 de novembro de 2026<\/strong>, com arena principal, secretariado, partidas e meta na <strong>Praia da Calif\u00f3rnia<\/strong>, em Sesimbra, distrito de Set\u00fabal (coordenadas 38.44188, -9.09623).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida de s\u00e1bado (7 de novembro) e domingo (8 de novembro)?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No <strong>s\u00e1bado (7 de novembro)<\/strong>, o festival e secretariado abrem \u00e0s 07h30; a <strong>Beast 21K<\/strong> parte \u00e0s <strong>09h00<\/strong> (Elite), 09h15 (Age Group) e 10h00 (Open); a <strong>Sprint 5K Open<\/strong> parte \u00e0s <strong>13h00<\/strong>; e a <strong>Spartan Kids<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>15h00<\/strong> (entrega de pr\u00e9mios Beast \u00e0s 13h30). No <strong>domingo (8 de novembro)<\/strong>, a <strong>Super 10K<\/strong> parte \u00e0s <strong>09h00<\/strong> (Elite), 09h15 (Age Group) e 10h00 (Open), com entrega de pr\u00e9mios \u00e0s 12h30 e partida da <strong>Sprint 5K Open<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>13h00<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, n\u00famero de obst\u00e1culos e pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento integra quatro formatos: <strong>Beast 21K<\/strong> (21 km, 30 obst\u00e1culos, desde <strong>177,01 \u20ac<\/strong>), <strong>Super 10K<\/strong> (10 km, 25 obst\u00e1culos, desde <strong>148,50 \u20ac<\/strong>), <strong>Sprint 5K<\/strong> (5 km, 20 obst\u00e1culos, desde <strong>108,58 \u20ac<\/strong>) e <strong>Kids Race<\/strong> (1 a 3 km com obst\u00e1culos, desde <strong>34,47 \u20ac<\/strong>). Existe tamb\u00e9m o <strong>Trifecta Pass Portugal<\/strong> por <strong>332,00 \u20ac<\/strong> para quem completar a Sprint, Super e Beast no mesmo fim de semana.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Com que anteced\u00eancia devo chegar para levantar o dorsal e quando sai o Guia do Atleta?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o recomenda a chegada <strong>90 minutos antes da hora de partida<\/strong> atribu\u00edda, para estacionar, levantar o dorsal (dispon\u00edvel no s\u00e1bado das 07h30 \u00e0s 16h30 e no domingo das 07h30 \u00e0s 15h00), entregar a mochila no bengaleiro e aquecer. O <strong>Guia do Atleta<\/strong> oficial \u00e9 disponibilizado na p\u00e1gina da prova uma semana antes do evento.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funcionam as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es para volunt\u00e1rios no Spartan Sesimbra?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os volunt\u00e1rios que apoiam a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o na arena e nos obst\u00e1culos do Spartan Sesimbra recebem acesso gratuito a uma corrida Spartan \u00e0 escolha (Super ou Sprint), al\u00e9m de equipamento de staff e alimenta\u00e7\u00e3o durante o turno.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Sesimbra Spartan Trifecta 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-07\", \"endDate\": \"2026-11-07\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": 